{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664070/extras/About_The_Game_Banner.png?t=1748534106\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore the quirky town of Larcenest Gap. Take pictures with your camera and write articles in your journal. Interact with the people who have daily routines and help them with their various tasks. Use your investigating skills to unravel the mystery surrounding this town. <br><br> <img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664070/extras/DaynNight.gif?t=1748534106\" /><br>Day and night cycle - Experience a different environment at night as you see the people and other creatures go about their daily routines.<br><br>[GIF] <br>Camera - Take pictures of everything you like and of what the townspeople ask you. <br><br>[GIF]<br>Journal - Full freedom to write whatever you like and customize your journal into something personal. <br><br>[GIF]<br>Publish - Have your articles posted around the town. <br><br>[GIF]<br>Collect - Find stickers and gnomes scattered around the area.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3664070?t=1748534106","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664070/3bec93f1807bcc22c53f1fc2b2f45fe191ad4c29/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1748534106","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664070/c803692b3a6a765ea4d4aa8a916f2269ad256dbe/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1748534106","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664070/c803692b3a6a765ea4d4aa8a916f2269ad256dbe/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1748534106","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_d